{"route":"coda","routeLabel":"Coda","scriptId":"3902_2","lineCount":27,"lines":[{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:1","line":1,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ああっ、ああっ、ああっ！\nだ、だめ、そこ…春希くん駄目っ…\nやぁぁぁぁんっ、あっ、あ～っ！」","english":"“Aaah, aaah, aaah! N-no, not there… Haruki, don’t… Noooo… ah, aaah!”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:2","line":2,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「………っ、\nぃ、ぅ、ぅぅ…」","english":"“Ngh… uh…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:3","line":3,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「そ、そんなに…されたらぁ…あぁぁぁ…ぁんっ、\nま、また…また…っ、ひぅぅんっ、ん、ん～っ」","english":"“I-if you keep doing that… I-I’ll… I’ll come again…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:4","line":4,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「は…ぁ、はぁ、はぁぁ…っ、\nひっ、ぅ…ぃっく…ぅ、ぅぁ…」","english":"“Ah… ahh… ngh…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:5","line":5,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「う、ううん…違、違う、の…\nそ、それは、その…やめ、ないで…\n今の…すごく、よかっ…あぁぁぁぁっ、あんっ」","english":"“N-no… that’s not what I meant… D-don’t stop… That just felt so good… aaah!”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:6","line":6,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「～っ、ぃ、ぃぃ…はっ、ん、んんっ…\nひくっ、ぅぅ…ぃっぅ…はぁ、ぁぁぁ…っ」","english":"“Ah… mmm… ahhh…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:7","line":7,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ん、んぅ…ちゅぷ…は、あむ…ん、んぅ…\nは、はうひ…ふん…もっろ…あ、あむ…んちゅ…\nんくっ、んっ、んんっ…んおぅんっ、ぷぁっ…」","english":"“Mm… Haruki… more… mmm…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:8","line":8,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「は～…は～…はぁぁぁぁ～…っ、\nぃくっ、ぅ…ぅぁぁぁん…ん…ぃ、ぅぅ…」","english":"“Ah… ahhh… ngh…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:9","line":9,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「わ、わらひ…も、もう…もふっ…ん、んむ…ちゅぅぅ…\nはむっ、はっ、あっ、あっ、あっ、あっ…ああああっ、\nは、ぁぁ…きて、春希く…なか…あ、なか、に…っ」","english":"“I-I’m… almost… Haruki… come… inside me…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:10","line":10,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「～っ！\nんっ、んっ…っ、そ…ぉぉ…ぃぃぃんっ、ん…っ」","english":"“Ngh… ah…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:11","line":11,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ああっ、ああっ、ああああ…っ！\nんんっ、んんっ、ん～っ！\nあ、あ、あ、あ、あ…も、もう…わたし、わたし…っ」","english":"“Ah… ahhh! I’m… I’m…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:12","line":12,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「春希………ぃ、\nう、あ…あぁぁ…ひぐっ、ぅ…ぅぅ…\nん～っ、ん、んっ…んぅぅぅぅっ」","english":"“Haruki… ah… ngh… mmm…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:13","line":13,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「あああああ…あっ、ああ………あ～っ！\nあああああああぁぁぁぁぁぁぁ～っ！！！」","english":"“Ahhhhhhhhh!”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:14","line":14,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「っっっ！\nふぅぅぅぅ～っ、う、ん～っ！」","english":"“—! Mmm…!”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:15","line":15,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ああああっ…あああっ…ああっ………あ…\nあぅっ、あ、ん…あ、熱…春希くん…の…あぁぁ」","english":"“Ah… It’s hot… Haruki… inside…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:16","line":16,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「はぁ、はぁ、はぁぁ…ぁぁ…\nはぁぁ、ぁぁ………ぁ」","english":"“Hah… hah… haaah…\nHaaah… ah…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:17","line":17,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ふ、ぅ…はぁぁ…はぁぁぁぁ…っ、\nはぁ、はぁ…は、あ、あ…春希、く…んっ…\nんぅ…んぷ…」","english":"“Haruki… mm… ah…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:18","line":18,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「………っ」","english":"“…!”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:19","line":19,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「ちゅぷぁ…あ、あむ…むぁぁ…あ、ぷ…\nはっ、はぁ…はぁぁぁ…ちゅぅぅ…ぅ、んっ」","english":"“Mm… ah… mmm…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:20","line":20,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「ぁ………ぁ、ぁ…っ」","english":"“Ah… ah…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:21","line":21,"speakerJa":"雪菜","speakerEn":"Setsuna","japanese":"「春希くん…はる、き…くんっ…\nあぁ…あぁぁ…はぁぁぁんっ、ん、んぷ…んっ」","english":"“Haruki… Haruki… ah…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:22","line":22,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「んぅぅぅぅ…ぅ…\nひくっ、う、う、う…ぅぇぇぇぇ…っ」","english":"“Ngh… ah… ahhh…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:23","line":23,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「ひぅっ…う、うぅ…ん…んぅ…\nご、めん…」","english":"“Ah… I’m sorry…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:24","line":24,"speakerJa":"かずさ","speakerEn":"Kazusa","japanese":"「ごめん…ごめん、ごめん…春希。\n許して、許して許して………雪菜、ぁ」","english":"“I’m sorry… I’m sorry, I’m sorry… Haruki. Forgive me, forgive me, forgive me… Setsuna…”"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:25","line":25,"speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"………","english":"…"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:26","line":26,"speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"……","english":"…"},{"ref":"wa2:coda:3902_2:27","line":27,"speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","japanese":"…","english":"…"}]}
